{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1000_018ele", "source_sha256": "5389b309b60bc0b6d25a2b2e0840cff6385ca8b89d2969099f6ceed8de457011", "ja": "見て見て、{$P$}！　新しい衣装、\n着てみたヨ！　どう？　似合う？", "zh": "你看你看，{$P$}！新衣服穿上啦！怎么样？好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5d3bff35ad69258033a1a30b7099ac74737e000d2a6e112f3e983c965149e87e", "ja": "うん、よく似合ってるぞ！　華やかでいい感じだな。", "zh": "嗯，很适合你！华丽又漂亮，感觉很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1002_018ele", "source_sha256": "509423d3e172f94bed960823ffa7537dd53c0e846f319ab0f0c9af7ffaa28522", "ja": "エヘヘ、ありがとっ！\n和服が似合うって言われるの、嬉しいナ～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢你！  \n被说很适合和服，我好开心呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "f5d37fa4e6ddab293e39b0bd73b2c6d72de261f2797935f3e7d027a5129a647f", "ja": "これって和服だけど、とっても動きやすいノ！\nこれならダンスもバッチリだヨ～。", "zh": "虽然这是和服，但穿起来非常方便活动！\n这样一来跳舞也完全没问题啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "39059e888b4e21977c64b9d20654a5a0b4f8108d9d349400945ba04ea9d127ae", "ja": "まあ和服って言っても、その辺は衣装だしな。\n……うん、髪型もいい感じじゃないか。", "zh": "虽说叫和服，但毕竟也是演出服嘛。\n……嗯，发型看起来也挺不错啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "a667d7f4f4355270e6664344f9aeb2500dd2fe10389bb04eec0340eb512a6d7d", "ja": "ホント？　やったネ！　けっこう時間、\nかかったんだヨ～。ミサキに手伝ってもらったんだ。", "zh": "真的？太好了！可是花了不少时间呢～是美咲帮我一起弄的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ab8ebaf4728eeef64ec0a70ddb78ea596b348bddfbdfe6ce1a24c517848ad6dc", "ja": "そうか、その価値はあったな。\n衣装も髪型も、すごくピッタリだと思う。", "zh": "这样啊，看来很值得。\n我觉得服装和发型都非常合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "b0fd1abf887fd890c9b32f3eefb5a2400d484660ba264ece4ecd32c2cd2e72b1", "ja": "エヘヘ……♪　うう～っ！\nなんだか、テンション上がってきたヨ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪呜呜～！\n不知怎么的，情绪越来越高涨了哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "52f107cf93adfd6397db3dc86a1477e012c6ac862dd36644d5af6eb81f4bce6b", "ja": "お祭り気分って言うのかナ？\nダンスしたくて、ウズウズしてきちゃった！", "zh": "这就叫节日气氛高涨吧？\n我都迫不及待想跳舞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1009_p", "source_sha256": "5b1e6a7a45170712f3d6426216dce8a5011749e1b69527b916afe33ebb50ebe5", "ja": "抑えて、抑えて……今日は試着だけだし。\nダンスはレッスンルームで頼むよ。", "zh": "克制一下，克制一下……今天只是试穿而已。\n要跳舞就去练习室吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "de5b19e6883bcd400e568293ed5b69641a3f1fd03acc817d300b910d187b81ff", "ja": "ウン、ガマンするヨ～……。\nでも、ホントにステキな衣装だよネ♪", "zh": "嗯，我会忍住的哟～……\n不过，这套服装真的很漂亮呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "03b2754a2610f82699d1dd13ad46b26e01d9d1572737019ba6ddbde7ada2e6fa", "ja": "プライベートでも着たいナ～。\nこの衣装でお祭りに行ったら、楽しそうだよネ！", "zh": "就算是私下也想穿穿看呢～。\n穿着这身服装去参加祭典，感觉会很开心呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "ca695e27dce3499697842e5afe51d87f2e4f44a20cc84e254eeea6ee621aca23", "ja": "でも衣装だから、無理だよネ～。\nうう、ガマン、ガマン……。", "zh": "不过毕竟是演出服，没办法穿出去吧～。\n呜呜，要忍耐，要忍耐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "4dc0c6cc504724949a589dfc992e2e9947964ed1d3b0610f32f849f0bb090977", "ja": "まあ、プライベートはちょっとな。けど……\nお祭りだったら、どうにかなるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "嗯，私下里就有点困难了。不过……\n要是祭典的话，说不定就能想想办法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "fd1fab2b8e9a1be009091aac8a1d05152dcb68c05f9e8dad71ed5271d9c72675", "ja": "エッ？　どういうコト……？", "zh": "诶？什么意思……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fced0073a16bd03d7cb13b9da8ec414eb19396b7c7b5ac473b3815398c5c0ee4", "ja": "劇場で、お祭りっぽいイベントをするんだよ。\n地元の商店街とタイアップして、出店とかも出して。", "zh": "我们要在剧场举办一场类似庆典的活动。\n还会和当地商店街合作，设置摊位之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "488fb58af0479324d8bfe474ac1258409eb77859ace911b737bb957754adaa07", "ja": "ワオ！　いいネ、すっごく楽しそうだヨ～。\nきっと盛り上がっちゃうネ！", "zh": "哇！不错呀，感觉超有意思的～  \n一定会热闹起来的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "3ef907774d9a1a6a9aefb7846394c1ae2c2647e5bdae801baeff6a85868814a9", "ja": "ファンのみんなも浴衣で、\n劇場のみんなも和風の衣装で、一緒に踊るノ！", "zh": "粉丝们也穿上浴衣，剧场的大家也换上和风服装，一起跳舞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "4210be0f475e2e6665ba49a450c6080967d0a50b4424984af6304b85acdb6260", "ja": "ワタシはこの衣装で、髪型もこれにして……。\nうう～っ、楽しみだナ～！　イエーイ！", "zh": "我要穿这套服装，发型也要弄成这样……  \n呜呜～好期待啊～！耶——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "54874ed1d523ea6e77fcd998ca136e96eb8513b193f3f6824deaf3f8f91cb7ff", "ja": "あっ、こら、ダンスはダメだってば。", "zh": "啊，喂，都说了不能跳舞嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0244_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "8433f52c579f6e26765d95fd8f163a137bef0f9b04349ce2fcda8af8bb81c91c", "ja": "っとと、ゴメンナサイ！　体が勝手に動いちゃった。\nガマン、ガマンだヨ～……！", "zh": "哎呀，对不起！身体不由自主地动起来了。\n要忍住，要忍住哦～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
